OL,3,GNEWSAMy bioethanol heater exploded and 
OL,4,Aset me on fire - I thought I would die 
OL,6,FA mother is trying to rebuild her life 
OL,7,Fafter a summer evening with family and 
OL,8,Ffriends "turned into a nightmare" when 
OL,9,Fher table top heater exploded.         
OL,11,FSaffron Carthew had fourth-degree burns
OL,12,Fand severe injuries from smoke         
OL,13,Finhalation before being placed in an   
OL,14,Finduced coma for five weeks after the  
OL,15,FJuly explosion caused her skin and hair
OL,16,Fto "fall off".                         
OL,18,FShe had bought the fire on social      
OL,19,Fmedia, and is now raising awareness    
OL,20,Fabout the pitfalls of online           
OL,21,Fmarketplaces.                          
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
