OL,3,GNEWSAMy bioethanol heater exploded and 
OL,4,Aset me on fire - I thought I would die 
OL,6,FTikTok said they take the safety of    
OL,7,Ftheir customers "extremely seriously"  
OL,8,Fand that the product in question was   
OL,9,Fremoved from sale earlier this year,   
OL,10,Fwith the seller no longer active on    
OL,11,FTikTok shop.                           
